('Crystal forest guardian', 'Genre: Action Adventure (2D/3D)\n\nStory\n\nA mystical forest is dying because the ancient elemental crystals have been stolen by shadow spirits. You play as the young guardian chosen to restore the balance.\n\nGameplay\n\nExplore forest regions\n\nSolve nature-based puzzles\n\nFight shadow creatures\n\nRestore crystals to giant tree shrines\n\nExperience\n\nMagical, calm but adventurous, nature-themed.', 'https://applaa-royal-stack.vercel.app', '💎', 'godot', true),
('Royal Stak Cards', 'Genre: Strategy / Puzzle (like Solitaire) Players: Single-player \n\n⭐ Features \n\nDrag-and-drop card stacks \n\n100+ levels with challenges \n\nDaily rewards \n\nZen mode (no timer) \n\nPower-ups (undo, shuffle, hint)', 'https://applaa-shadow-runner.vercel.app', '🎮', 'godot', true),
('Shadow Runner', 'Create a game called "Shadow Runner" \n\nStyle: 2D side-scrolling runner Inspiration: Temple Run + Jetpack Joyride \n\n⭐ Gameplay \n\nPlayer runs automatically \n\nTap → Jump \n\nHold → Long jump \n\nSlide under obstacles \n\nCollect coins \n\nEnemies shoot lasers \n\nPower-ups (shield, slow motion, jetpack) \n\n⭐ Levels \n\nCity rooftops \n\nOld ruins \n\nJungle temple \n\nCyber world', 'https://applaa-mono-fleet.vercel.app', '👤', 'godot', true),
('Mono Fleet', '2D vertical shooter (shmup) game screenshot, inspired by Galaga or Space Invaders. The entire scene is rendered in stark, high-contrast monochrome pixels (black and white or black and a single, low-fidelity blue). The player''s ship is at the bottom, firing a stream of blocky projectiles at a formation of geometric enemy ships (triangles and squares) descending from the top. Focus on the retro, rigid movement of the enemies, but with a modern screen refresh rate and smooth player controls polish. Include a visible "LIVES: X X X" count at the bottom.', NULL, '🎮', 'godot', true),
